      "label": "T_PlayingByAppointment",
      "span": "maybe only 5-10 minutes for a new life",
      "rule_applied": "Wait to Play [low-level]",
      "rationale": "Implies lives currently regenerate on an in-game timer slower than the reviewer would like — an imposed wait before playing again."
    },
    {
      "label": "T_DailyRewards",
      "span": "just because you miss a day doesnt mean that you need to start over on your daily prizes",
      "rule_applied": "definition / boundary rule vs Playing by Appointment",
      "rationale": "Describes a daily login reward streak with an active consequence for missing a day: the prize progress resets to the start."
