      "label": "M_PayToProgress",
      "span": "to have any change at progressing you need to purchase",
      "rule_applied": "Pay Wall: 'Patterns that make the game unplayable without payment.'",
      "rationale": "The reviewer states that progress is only possible by purchasing, making advancement contingent on payment."
